<TD WIDTH="4%" VALIGN="top" ALIGN="left"><B>A:</B></TD>
<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman; " ALIGN="left">We are a Maryland corporation formed on July&nbsp;18, 2022. We invest primarily in high-quality, stabilized
real estate assets within the United States and are externally managed by the Advisor, Cohen&nbsp;&amp; Steers Capital Management, Inc., a New York corporation. The Advisor is a subsidiary of Cohen&nbsp;&amp; Steers, Inc. (our &#8220;Sponsor&#8221;
and, together with its subsidiaries, &#8220;Cohen&nbsp;&amp; Steers,&#8221; unless the context otherwise requires). </P></TD></TR></TABLE>  <P STYLE="font-size:18pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
<TABLE STYLE="BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt" BORDER="0" CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%">
