<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P ALIGN="left" STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt">Shares of listed REITs are priced by the trading market, which is generally influenced by numerous factors, not
all of which are related to the underlying value of the entity&#8217;s real estate assets and liabilities. Our board of directors, rather than the &#8220;market,&#8221; determined the initial offering price of our shares in its sole discretion after
considering the initial public offering prices per share of other blind pool <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">non-traded</FONT> REITs. The estimated value of our real estate assets and liabilities, rather than the trading market, is used to
determine our NAV. </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
<TABLE STYLE="BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt" BORDER="0" CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%">
