until the earlier of (1)&nbsp;December&nbsp;31, 2026 or (2)&nbsp;the month that our aggregate NAV is at least $750 million; and </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
