<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">To the extent we borrow funds to pay distributions, we would incur borrowing costs and these borrowings would require a future repayment. </P>
<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">If we defer operating expenses or pay expenses (including the fees of the Advisor or distributions to the Special Limited Partner) with shares
