we have acquired or will acquire would not be materially different if such statements or metrics had been independently audited or reviewed. </P>
<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">Consultants, legal advisors, appraisers, accountants, investment banks and other third parties may be involved in the due diligence process
