<P STYLE="margin-top:18pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman"><B><I>We may utilize <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">non-recourse</FONT> securitizations of certain of our CMBS investments, which may expose us to risks
