<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">In respect of such insurance arrangements, Cohen&nbsp;&amp; Steers may make corrective allocations from time to time should it determine
