Stock.&#8221; </P> <P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">We seek to act in the best interests of the Company as a whole and not in consideration of the particular tax consequences
to any specific stockholder. Potential <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">non-U.S.</FONT> holders should inform themselves as to the U.S. federal income tax consequences, and the tax consequences within the countries of their citizenship, residence,
domicile, and place of business, with respect to the purchase, ownership and disposition of shares of our common stock. </P>
