<P STYLE="margin-top:18pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman"><B><I>Joint Ventures and Other <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">Co-Ownership</FONT> Arrangements </I></B></P>
