<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">The affiliate transaction committee is responsible for reviewing and approving the terms of all transactions between us and Cohen&nbsp;&amp;
