<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">We pay the Advisor a management fee regardless of the performance of our portfolio. The Advisor&#8217;s entitlement to a management fee, which
