participation interest in Class&nbsp;I units or any other units in the Operating Partnership, (d)&nbsp;how quickly we invest </P> <P STYLE="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">the proceeds from this and
