 <P STYLE="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman" ALIGN="center"><B><A NAME="rom90063_16"></A>CERTAIN PROVISIONS OF MARYLAND LAW AND OUR CHARTER AND BYLAWS
</B></P> <P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">The following description of the terms of certain provisions of Maryland law and our charter and bylaws is only a summary. For a
