lesser of 1% of the REIT&#8217;s total assets and $10,000,000 and (ii)&nbsp;the REIT either disposes of the assets causing the failure within six months after the last day of the quarter in which
it identifies the failure, or the relevant tests are otherwise satisfied within that time frame. </P> <P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">Even if we did not qualify for the
